    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Farmer\u2019s Loop \u2013 A Loop-Based Idle Farming Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Farmer\u2019s Loop is a loop-based idle game where you set up a sequence of actions inside your loop. Each loop earns you rewards\u2014whether it\u2019s crops, animal products, or other resources\u2014that you can sell for profit or use to sustain your farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell your goods to expand your farm with more land, better buildings, and stronger seeds. Or reinvest in tools and equipment to make your loop faster and more efficient!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What\u2019s Currently in the Game?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Farming \u2013 Of course, it\u2019s a farming game! Grow crops and manage your fields.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Animals \u2013 No farm is complete without livestock. Whether it\u2019s one or two\u2026 or 200!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Resource Management \u2013 Sell your products or use them to feed your animals\u2014choose wisely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Buildings \u2013 Expand with barns, coops, and storage to keep your farm running smoothly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 And More!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What\u2019s Coming Next?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc04 More Animals \u2013 Expand your farm with new companions!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0 More Tools &amp; Equipment \u2013 Bigger, better, and more efficient farming gear.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 More NPCs \u2013 More friendly faces to meet and interact with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddec Animal Genetics \u2013 Breed animals with unique traits!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd9 A City Map \u2013 Explore beyond your farm!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd7 More Buildings \u2013 Expand your farm with even more structures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf53 More Seeds &amp; Fruits \u2013 Grow a greater variety of crops!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 And so much more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Current Dev Goal</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 NPCs \u2013 Chat with friendly neighbors and build relationships within the community!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get Involved!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Discord to stay updated, share feedback, and be part of the game\u2019s development. You can even give feedback live on Twitch (link in discord)\u2014your input helps shape the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
