 class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd7 More Buildings \u2013 Expand your farm with even more structures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf53 More Seeds &amp; Fruits \u2013 Grow a greater variety of crops!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 And so much more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Current Dev Goal</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 NPCs \u2013 Chat with friendly neighbors and build relationships within the community!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Get Involved!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Discord to stay updated, share feedback, and be part of the game\u2019s development. You can even give feedback live on Twitch (link in discord)\u2014your input helps shape the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
